{
  "format": "srwb",
  "format_version": "1.0",
  "exported_at": "2026-08-15T17:25:01.719Z",
  "notebook": {
    "id": "default",
    "name": "调用图分析与强连通分量 (SCC) 检测",
    "autoNameNumber": null,
    "description": "",
    "kernelLanguage": "prolog",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 38,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# 调用图分析与强连通分量 (SCC) 检测\n\n本笔记本探讨了 UnifyWeaver 的高级代码分析功能：\n\n- **调用图构建** — 从 Prolog 代码构建依赖图\n- **SCC 检测** — 发现强连通分量（互递归）\n- **模式分析** — 理解递归模式\n- **依赖可视化** — 直观呈现谓词之间的关系\n\n## 学习目标\n\n- 理解 UnifyWeaver 如何分析代码结构\n- 构建并检查调用图\n- 使用 Tarjan 算法检测互递归\n- 对代码依赖进行可视化",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "## 环境配置\n\n加载 UnifyWeaver 及分析模块。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "% 加载初始化\n['../init'].\n\n% 加载分析模块\nuse_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/call_graph)).\nuse_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/scc_detection)).\nuse_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/pattern_matchers)).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Cannot find file: ../init",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Cannot find file: ../init</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "## 示例 1：简单调用图\n\n从一个简单的谓词开始并构建其调用图。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "% 定义 ancestor 谓词\n:- dynamic ancestor/2.\n:- dynamic parent/2.\n\n% parent 事实\nparent(abraham, isaac).\nparent(isaac, jacob).\n\n% ancestor 规则\nancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Y).\nancestor(X, Z) :- parent(X, Y), ancestor(Y, Z).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "### 构建调用图",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "% 为 ancestor 构建调用图\nbuild_call_graph([ancestor/2], _Graph),\nformat('Call Graph for ancestor/2:~n'),\nforall(member(_Edge, _Graph),\n    format('  ~w~n', [_Edge])).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "### 分析依赖关系",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "% 获取 ancestor/2 的所有依赖关系\nget_dependencies(ancestor/2, _Deps),\nformat('Dependencies of ancestor/2: ~w~n', [_Deps]).\n\n% 检查是否自递归\n(is_self_recursive(ancestor/2) ->\n    writeln('✓ ancestor/2 is self-recursive')\n;\n    writeln('✗ ancestor/2 is not self-recursive')\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: get_dependencies/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: get_dependencies/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "code": "## 示例 2：互递归检测\n\n现在通过奇偶数示例来检测互递归。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "code": "% 定义互递归谓词\n:- dynamic is_even/1.\n:- dynamic is_odd/1.\n\nis_even(0).\nis_even(N) :- N > 0, N1 is N - 1, is_odd(N1).\n\nis_odd(1).\nis_odd(N) :- N > 1, N1 is N - 1, is_even(N1).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "code": "### 为两个谓词构建调用图",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "code": "% 为这两个谓词构建调用图\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\nformat('Call Graph for is_even/1 and is_odd/1:~n'),\nforall(member(_Edge, _Graph),\n    format('  ~w~n', [_Edge])).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "code": "### 查找强连通分量 (SCC)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "code": "% 重新构建图，因为变量不会在笔记本单元格之间持久保存\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\n% 使用 Tarjan 算法查找 SCC\nfind_sccs(_Graph, _SCCs),\nformat('Strongly Connected Components:~n'),\nforall(member(_SCC, _SCCs),\n    format('  ~w~n', [_SCC])).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "code": "### 检查 SCC 是否为平凡分量",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "code": "% 重新计算衍生值，使该单元格也能独立运行\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\nfind_sccs(_Graph, _SCCs),\n% 检查每个 SCC\nforall(member(_SCC, _SCCs),\n    (   is_trivial_scc(_SCC) ->\n        format('  ~w is trivial (single predicate)~n', [_SCC])\n    ;\n        format('  ~w is NON-TRIVIAL (mutual recursion!)~n', [_SCC])\n    )\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "code": "## 示例 3：复杂调用图\n\n分析包含多个谓词的更复杂的系统。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "code": "% 定义一个包含多个谓词的小程序\n:- dynamic grandparent/2.\n:- dynamic sibling/2.\n:- dynamic cousin/2.\n\n% grandparent 使用 parent\ngrandparent(X, Z) :- parent(X, Y), parent(Y, Z).\n\n% sibling：相同父母，不同孩子\nsibling(X, Y) :- parent(P, X), parent(P, Y), X \\= Y.\n\n% cousin：父母是兄弟姐妹\ncousin(X, Y) :- parent(P1, X), parent(P2, Y), sibling(P1, P2).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "code": "### 构建完整调用图",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 21,
        "code": "% 为所有谓词构建调用图\nbuild_call_graph([grandparent/2, sibling/2, cousin/2], _Graph),\nformat('Complete Call Graph:~n'),\nforall(member(_Edge, _Graph),\n    format('  ~w~n', [_Edge])).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 22,
        "code": "### 查找谓词组\n\n查找包含起始谓词的互递归谓词组。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 23,
        "code": "% 查找包含 cousin/2 的互递归组\npredicates_in_group(cousin/2, _Group),\nformat('Mutually recursive group containing cousin/2: ~w~n', [_Group]).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: predicates_in_group/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: predicates_in_group/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 24,
        "code": "## 示例 4：模式检测\n\n使用模式匹配器分析递归类型。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "code": "% 定义各种递归模式\n:- dynamic count/3.     % 尾递归\n:- dynamic factorial/2. % 线性递归\n:- dynamic fib/2.       % 树形递归（若被检测到则为线性递归）\n\n% 尾递归计数\ncount([], Acc, Acc).\ncount([_|T], Acc, N) :-\n    Acc1 is Acc + 1,\n    count(T, Acc1, N).\n\n% 线性递归阶乘\nfactorial(0, 1).\nfactorial(N, F) :-\n    N > 0,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    factorial(N1, F1),\n    F is N * F1.\n\n% 斐波那契（可被检测为线性或树形递归）\nfib(0, 0).\nfib(1, 1).\nfib(N, F) :-\n    N > 1,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    N2 is N - 2,\n    fib(N1, F1),\n    fib(N2, F2),\n    F is F1 + F2.",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "code": "### 检测尾递归",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 27,
        "code": "% 检查 count/3 是否为尾递归\n(is_tail_recursive_accumulator(count/3, _AccInfo) ->\n    format('✓ count/3 is tail recursive: ~w~n', [_AccInfo])\n;\n    writeln('✗ count/3 is not tail recursive')\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: is_tail_recursive_accumulator/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: is_tail_recursive_accumulator/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 28,
        "code": "### 检测线性递归",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 29,
        "code": "% 检查 factorial/2 是否为线性递归\n(is_linear_recursive_streamable(factorial/2) ->\n    writeln('✓ factorial/2 is linear recursive')\n;\n    writeln('✗ factorial/2 is not linear recursive')\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: is_linear_recursive_streamable/1",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: is_linear_recursive_streamable/1</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 30,
        "code": "### 统计递归调用次数",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 31,
        "code": "% 统计 fibonacci 中的递归调用次数\nfunctor(_FibHead, fib, 2),\nuser:clause(_FibHead, _FibBody),\nonce(contains_call_to(_FibBody, fib)),\ncount_recursive_calls(_FibBody, fib, _Count),\nformat('Fibonacci body has ~w recursive calls~n', [_Count]).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "once/1: Unknown procedure: contains_call_to/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">once/1: Unknown procedure: contains_call_to/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 32,
        "code": "## DOT 格式可视化\n\n生成调用图的 Graphviz DOT 表示。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 33,
        "code": "% 用于生成 DOT 格式的辅助函数\ngenerate_dot(Graph, DotCode) :-\n    findall(Line,\n        (   member(From -> To, Graph),\n            format(atom(Line), '  \"~w\" -> \"~w\";', [From, To])\n        ),\n        Lines),\n    atomic_list_concat(['digraph CallGraph {', '  rankdir=LR;' | Lines], '\\n', Body),\n    format(atom(DotCode), '~w~n}~n', [Body]).\n\n% 为奇偶图生成 DOT\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\ngenerate_dot(_Graph, _DotCode),\nwriteln('DOT Code for even/odd call graph:'),\nwriteln(_DotCode).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 34,
        "code": "### 保存 DOT 文件",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 35,
        "code": "% 重新构建 DOT 源码，因为变量不会在单元格之间持久保存\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\ngenerate_dot(_Graph, _DotCode),\nsetup_call_cleanup(\n    open('/shared/data/even_odd_graph.dot', write, _Stream),\n    write(_Stream, _DotCode),\n    close(_Stream)),\nwriteln('✓ Saved to /shared/data/even_odd_graph.dot').\n\nwriteln('To visualize, run:'),\nwriteln('  dot -Tpng /shared/data/even_odd_graph.dot -o even_odd_graph.png').",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 36,
        "code": "## 练习：分析你自己的代码\n\n尝试定义你自己的谓词并对其进行分析！",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 37,
        "code": "% 在此定义你的谓词\n% 然后构建调用图，查找 SCC 并检测模式\n\n% 示例：\n% :- dynamic my_predicate/2.\n% my_predicate(...) :- ...\n\n% build_call_graph([my_predicate/2], Graph).\n",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 38,
        "code": "## 总结\n\n在本笔记本中，你学习了：\n\n✅ 如何从 Prolog 代码构建调用图\n\n✅ 如何检测互递归的强连通分量 (SCC)\n\n✅ 如何使用模式匹配器分类递归类型\n\n✅ 如何分析谓词依赖关系\n\n✅ 如何使用 DOT 格式可视化调用图\n\n## 进阶主题\n\n深入分析主题：\n\n- **拓扑排序**：使用 `topological_order/2` 按依赖关系对 SCC 进行排序\n- **自定义模式匹配器**：编写专属模式检测谓词\n- **累加器模式提取**：使用 `extract_accumulator_pattern/2` 进行详细分析\n- **禁用线性递归**：使用 `forbid_linear_recursion/1` 强制采用其他编译策略\n\n## 参考与相关文件\n\n- 第 10 章：Prolog 内省与理论\n- `src/unifyweaver/core/advanced/call_graph.pl`\n- `src/unifyweaver/core/advanced/scc_detection.pl`\n- `src/unifyweaver/core/advanced/pattern_matchers.pl`",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      }
    ]
  }
}